SPEC = {'setting': 'Warm Miyazaki-inspired hand-painted Japanese animation food illustration. Honey wood and ivory ceramics. Soft cel shading, no photorealism, no diagrams, no text. No hands.', 'steps': ['Precise shrimp preparation on honey wooden board: three peeled raw jumbo grey-translucent prawns each with tail fan intact. One is belly-up with three shallow diagonal scoring cuts across the underside, the body straight. Another shows shallow back slit with vein removed. Small kitchen scissors and paring knife laid safely beside. NO hands. Do not split shrimp in half, no deep butterfly cuts.', 'An ivory bowl of pale very thin cold tempura batter with a few small visible flour lumps, resting within larger shallow bowl of ice. Two wooden chopsticks rest across rim. One straight tail-on raw jumbo prawn held by long wooden cooking chopsticks with handles out of frame, lifted from batter, thin translucent coating dripping back. Small plate of lightly flour-dusted raw tail-on prawns beside. No hands, no panko or breadcrumbs.', 'A deep stainless pot less than half filled with frying oil, two long straight tail-on jumbo prawns frying in delicate pale golden tempura batter, small lively bubbles. One mesh spider just lifting one cooked prawn, handle exits frame. No hands, no breadcrumbs, no brown heavy breading, no splashes, no oil filled to rim.', 'Four long straight jumbo tail-on shrimp tempura on a small wire rack above an ivory serving plate, airy pale-gold lace-like thin batter, orange-red tail fans. One broken piece shows fully opaque pearly white cooked shrimp. Small bowl of light amber dipping sauce, grated daikon mound and lemon wedge beside. No sushi, no panko breading, no hands.'], 'hero': 'Four long straight jumbo tail-on shrimp tempura on a small wire rack above an ivory serving plate, airy pale-gold lace-like thin batter, orange-red tail fans. One broken piece shows fully opaque pearly white cooked shrimp. Small bowl of light amber dipping sauce, grated daikon mound and lemon wedge beside. No sushi, no panko breading, no hands.', 'mise': []}
